 with no rain, and the Sun beats down.","ta":"பிறகு நீண்ட வறண்ட காலம் வருகிறது. வாரங்கள் மழையின்றிக் கடக்கின்றன; சூரியன் சுட்டெரிக்கிறது."}},{"c":{"en":"The soil dries and cracks. The water in tanks and wells falls.","ta":"மண் காய்ந்து வெடிக்கிறது. ஏரிகளிலும் கிணறுகளிலும் நீர்மட்டம் குறைகிறது."}},{"c":{"en":"Plants wilt. Pumping more groundwater to cope can make the shortage worse.","ta":"செடிகள் வாடுகின்றன. சமாளிக்க நிலத்தடி நீரை அதிகம் இறைத்தால் பற்றாக்குறை மேலும் மோசமாகலாம்."}},{"c":{"en":"Saving water, harvesting rain and desilting tanks all help us get through dry spells.","ta":"நீரைச் சேமிப்பது, மழைநீரைச் சேகரிப்பது, ஏரிகளைத் தூர்வாருவது ஆகியவை வறண்ட காலத்தைக் கடக்க உதவுகின்றன."}}]},"gh":{"bg":"day","e":[{"a":{"fill":"#6b8f4e","height":44,"width":400,"x":0,"y":196},"k":"sh","t":"rect"},{"k":"sun","r":22,"x":55,"y":40},{"col":"#ffd66b","k":"flow","n":4,"spd":0.25,"x1":95,"x2":150,"y1":52,"y2":190},{"col":"#ffd66b","k":"flow","n":4,"spd":0.25,"x1":130,"x2":210,"y1":40,"y2":190},{"col":"#ffd66b","k":"flow","n":4,"spd":0.25,"x1":170,"x2":270,"y1":34,"y2":190},{"col":"#ff6a4a","k":"flow","n":5,"s":[1,1],"x1":300,"x2":300,"y1":190,"y2":16},{"col":"#ff6a4a","k":"flow","n":5,"s":[1,1],"x1":345,"x2":345,"y1":190,"y2":16},{"a":{"fill":"#9fb0bd","height":46,"width":400,"x":0,"y":86},"k":"sh","opacity":0.28,"s":[2,3],"t":"rect"},{"a":{"cx":12,"cy":88,"fill":"#cfe8f5","r":3},"k":"sh","mv":[4,3,2.5],"s":[2,3],"t":"circle"},{"a":{"cx":59,"cy":117,"fill":"#cfe8f5","r":3},"k":"sh","mv":[4,3,3],"s":[2,3],"t":"circle"},{"a":{"cx":106,"cy":106,"fill":"#cfe8f5","r":3},"k":"sh","mv":[4,3,3.5],"s":[2,3],"t":"circle"},{"a":{"cx":153,"cy":95,"fill":"#cfe8f5","r":3},"k":"sh","mv":[4,3,4],"s":[2,3],"t":"circle"},{"a":{"cx":200,"cy":124,"fill":"#cfe8f5","r":3},"k":"sh","mv":[4,3,2.5],"s":[2,3],"t":"circle"},{"a":{"cx":247,"cy":113,"fill":"#cfe8f5","r":3},"k":"sh","mv":[4,3,3],"s":[2,3],"t":"circle"},{"a":{"cx":294,"cy":102,"fill":"#cfe8f5","r":3},"k":"sh","mv":[4,3,3.5],"s":[2,3],"t":"ci